Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 11:27:55 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1239/1252] HERESY 1169: the lyrics' mirrors take the box's
 fractional width (at 125 % its numbers, marks and tag highlights stood a row
 off after a line wrapped differently); the server log stands at the left
 while a frame is lifted, off Generate; the lifted lyrics two steps each way
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 08.10.2026: «При скейле 125% именно в полной странице в редакторе съезжают хайлайтинги секций»; «В попапе фреймов серверный лог поверх кнопки синтеза. В этом режиме смести его влево»; «В попапе лирики оставь два шага +… В минус тоже только два шага».

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/console/app.css          |  3 +++
 tools/console/app.js           | 30 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 tools/console/heresy-lyrics.js | 14 +++++++++++---
 3 files changed, 40 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/console/app.css b/tools/console/app.css
index d985897..c9ff56e 100644
--- a/tools/console/app.css
+++ b/tools/console/app.css
@@ -4537,3 +4537,6 @@ body:not([data-frame]) .frame-fs { display: none; }
 /* HERESY 1169 · 1239: the lyrics over everything have their own −, + and ⟲ in their head */
 .lyr-over-fs { display: inline-flex; gap: 4px; margin-right: 6px; }
 .lyr-over-fs .icon-btn .ui-ico { width: 16px; height: 16px; }
+
+/* HERESY 1169 · 1240: with a frame lifted the server log stands at the left (its width and height set by placeLogDock) */
+.log-dock.is-left { right: auto; left: 16px; }
